          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "Teletext will be skipped; no teletext on the remote."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#3",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The target user group should be below forty."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "TS3006b#4",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The new product will include an LCD screen and speech recognition."
        },
